/* ── Tincture · OKLCH palette generator ────────────────────────────────
   Colours live as OKLCH (lightness, chroma, hue). Harmony rules pick hues,
   lightness is spread so a palette always has a usable dark and light,
   and chroma is chosen as a share of the largest chroma sRGB can show at
   that lightness and hue (binary-searched), so nothing is silently
